@startuml C1_Missing_Plans_Scenario_View
title C1 – Missing Operation Plans (Scenario View)

left to right direction
skinparam usecase {
  BorderColor Black
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  ArrowColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
rectangle "Operation Plans Module" as System {
  usecase "List VVNs without Plan" as UC_List
  usecase "Review Missing Details" as UC_Details
  usecase "Confirm Regeneration" as UC_Regenerate
  usecase "View Regeneration Metadata" as UC_Metadata
  usecase "Acknowledge Overwrite Warning" as UC_Warning
}

Operator --> UC_List
Operator --> UC_Details
Operator --> UC_Regenerate
Operator --> UC_Metadata
Operator --> UC_Warning

note right of UC_Regenerate
  Runs scheduling algorithm for the selected day
  to rebuild Operation Plans for missing VVNs.
end note

note right of UC_Warning
  Operator must explicitly confirm that existing plans
  will be overwritten before regeneration proceeds.
end note

@enduml
